title: Dad
tags: history
---
Dad: Are you coming to your mum's birthday tonight?

Player: I'll be there.

Dad: Good. We can have a beer while you're around.

Dad: Kiddo, where are u? Mum's worried sick.

Player: What 4? I'm in the city.

Dad: You said you'd come around for cake tonight.

Dad: I can't believe I raised such a shameless man. You've gotta get off your high horse before someone knocks you off it.

Player: Whatever. I've messaged mum happy birthday.

Dad: Fat load of good that'll do. Don't even think about asking me for a lift home or I'll run you over.

--

Player: You and mum still pissed with me?

Dad: Why wouldn't we be?

Player: Maybe cos I'm your son and you should be nicer to me.

Dad: Maybe when you start showing some respect I will. You miss our birthdays, you never come by and all you do is waste the money and years of school we got you through.

Player: Get your head out of the past dad.

Dad: Get your head outta your ass first.

--

Player: Hey. You got 50 bucks to spare? I gotta top up my car

Dad: Long time no see to you too 

Player: Dad ;/

Dad: Fine yeah, I'll send ya the 50

Player: Thanks

Dad: Come by for dinner some time. You're looking thin as a twig on your photos.

Player: :P

